{"id":"n47450-1-7","stage":5,"title":"덩치 · 身材","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n47450-1-7-1","ko":"지수는 키도 크고 체격도 좋은데 겁이 많은 것 같아.","zh":"智秀个子高，体格也不错，但看起来好像很胆小。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수는","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"지수는","audio":"/audio/9ca6ce32d0646be4023e.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"키도","meaning":"身高，身长，个子，个儿，个头儿","explanation":"키：身高，身长，个子，个儿，个头儿；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"키","audio":"/audio/e37db65fd90db469af33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20269","senseId":"1","lemma":"키","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"크고","meaning":"大，高，长，壮阔","explanation":"크다：大，高，长，壮阔；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"1","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"체격도","meaning":"体格","explanation":"체격：体格；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"체격","audio":"/audio/2ed611bd0f22dbe6e1bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79362","senseId":"1","lemma":"체격","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋은데","meaning":"好，强","explanation":"좋다：好，强；은데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"15","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"겁이","meaning":"胆怯，害怕","explanation":"겁：胆怯，害怕；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"겁","audio":"/audio/3404e2048e920796c6ec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62260","senseId":"1","lemma":"겁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많은","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e37db65fd90db469","term":"키","zh":"身高，身长，个子，个儿，个头儿","audio":"/audio/e37db65fd90db469af33.mp3","entryId":"20269","definition":"人或动物站直时从脚到头的身体的长度。","pronunciation":["키"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"大，高，长，壮阔","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"长度、宽度、高度、体积等都超出了普通程度。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"2ed611bd0f22dbe6","term":"체격","zh":"体格","audio":"/audio/2ed611bd0f22dbe6e1bf.mp3","entryId":"79362","definition":"肌肉与骨骼等整个身体的外形。","pronunciation":["체격"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，强","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"和别的相比，质量或水平等更高。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"3404e2048e920796","term":"겁","zh":"胆怯，害怕","audio":"/audio/3404e2048e920796c6ec.mp3","entryId":"62260","definition":"因为恐惧而感到不安的心情。","pronunciation":["겁"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/7e842dd2236df9ac1028.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n47450-1-7-2","ko":"걔는 덩치 값도 못한다니까.","zh":"说她根本配不上她那副身材呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"걔는","meaning":"“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","explanation":"걔：“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"걔","audio":"/audio/6488cd1503b8fc1cb5fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64369","senseId":"1","lemma":"걔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"덩치","meaning":"身材，块头，身躯","explanation":"덩치：身材，块头，身躯","readings":[{"term":"덩치","audio":"/audio/9b713d470ac73099b1bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47450","senseId":"1","lemma":"덩치","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"값도","meaning":"表示与某个东西相符的价值或作用。","explanation":"값：表示与某个东西相符的价值或作用。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"값","audio":"/audio/b19ddf94b4c9896bb5c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20178","senseId":"7","lemma":"값","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못한다니까.","meaning":"不如，逊色","explanation":"못하다：不如，逊色；ㄴ다니까：再次强调已经说过的内容，非敬语：“都说了……”。","readings":[{"term":"못하다","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29719","senseId":"1","lemma":"못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6488cd1503b8fc1c","term":"걔","zh":"“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/6488cd1503b8fc1cb5fa.mp3","entryId":"64369","definition":"“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"9b713d470ac73099","term":"덩치","zh":"身材，块头，身躯","audio":"/audio/9b713d470ac73099b1bd.mp3","entryId":"47450","definition":"身体的大小和体积。","pronunciation":["덩치"]},{"id":"b19ddf94b4c9896b","term":"값","zh":"表示与某个东西相符的价值或作用。","audio":"/audio/b19ddf94b4c9896bb5c6.mp3","entryId":"20178","definition":"表示与某个东西相符的价值或作用。","pronunciation":["갑"]},{"id":"641e1150cc79b5b2","term":"못하다","zh":"不如，逊色","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3","entryId":"29719","definition":"互相比较时，程度或水平未达到某个程度。","pronunciation":["모ː타다"]}],"audio":"/audio/094cea601753f23cf60f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.402,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=47450","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":163,"sequenceScore":3.2287,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["智秀个子高，体格也不错，但看起来好像很胆小。","说她根本配不上她那副身材呢。","裕敏女士是在给女儿喂母乳吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["智秀个子高，体格也不错，但看起来好像很胆小。","说她根本配不上她那副身材呢。","裕敏女士是在给女儿喂母乳吗？"],"answer":1}]}
